## 11. Findings & Reporting

### Severity Classification
| Severity | CVSS Range | SLA | Example |
|----------|-----------|-----|---------|
| Critical | 9.0-10.0 | 24h notification | RCE, auth bypass |
| High | 7.0-8.9 | In report | SQLi, privilege escalation |
| Medium | 4.0-6.9 | In report | XSS, IDOR |
| Low | 0.1-3.9 | In report | Info disclosure |
| Informational | 0.0 | Appendix | Best practice |

### Report Structure
1. Executive Summary
2. Scope & Methodology
3. Findings (by severity)
4. Risk Assessment
5. Remediation Recommendations
6. Appendices (raw output, evidence)

